{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61097,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9532e17cad53113e56f6bf27a382300","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I finally have this all put together and ready to mail on Monday (which will be about a month before the wedding).&amp;nbsp; I had finished the luggage tags ages ago but waited on the mailers because I kept redesigning it and adding more info.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; For the luggage tags I used clear rigid tags - I wanted something a little more substantial than a typical badge holder yet didn&#039;t want the permanence of self laminating.&amp;nbsp; I ordered the tags&amp;nbsp;from the link below&amp;nbsp;and then the straps from Amazon.&amp;nbsp; I printed a few different designs using Microsoft Publisher - one side has a tropical beach picture (just random photos on-line)&amp;nbsp;with wording I borrowed from another BDW bride and the other has one of our logos with the name and address lines.&amp;nbsp; They are standard business card size so&amp;nbsp;I figure people can continue to use them however they please.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC00889.JPG\" height=\"365\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/417000\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" style=\"width: 559px; height: 407px\" width=\"445\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"DSC00891.JPG\" height=\"418\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/417002\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" style=\"width: 559px; height: 445px\" width=\"436\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"DSC00893.JPG\" height=\"474\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/417006\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" style=\"width: 559px; height: 376px\" width=\"516\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"DSC00895.JPG\" height=\"412\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/417009\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" style=\"width: 559px; height: 425px\" width=\"519\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC00897.JPG\" height=\"376\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/417011\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" style=\"width: 560px; height: 394px\" width=\"540\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1449494,"PostDate":1305042166,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I finally have this all put together and ready to mail on Monday (which will be about a month before the wedding).\u00a0 I had finished the luggage tags ages ago but waited on the mailers because I kept redesigning it and adding more info.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For the luggage tags I used clear rigid tags - I wanted something a little more substantial than a typical badge holder yet didn't want the permanence of self laminating.\u00a0 I ordered the tags\u00a0from the link below\u00a0and then the straps from Amazon.\u00a0 I printed a few different designs using Microsoft Publisher - one side has a tropical beach picture (just random photos on-line)\u00a0with wording I borrowed from another BDW bride and the other has one of our logos with the name and address lines.\u00a0 They are standard business card size so\u00a0I figure people can continue to use them however they please.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00889.JPG\" height=\"365\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/417000\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" style=\"width: 559px; height: 407px\" width=\"445\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00891.JPG\" height=\"418\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/417002\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" style=\"width: 559px; height: 445px\" width=\"436\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00893.JPG\" height=\"474\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/417006\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" style=\"width: 559px; height: 376px\" width=\"516\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00895.JPG\" height=\"412\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/417009\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" style=\"width: 559px; height: 425px\" width=\"519\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00897.JPG\" height=\"376\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/417011\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" style=\"width: 560px; height: 394px\" width=\"540\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Steph & John........Atlantis.......June 18, 2011......happily married<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"steph@tmgatl.com","IpAddress":"75.150.14.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1283270642,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231931.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"skp1","Id":231931,"Name":"skp1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61097,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey"